    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Assumptions (JAW-9927)\n\n- Webhook POST `telegram`; payload accepts `message.text` and `message.chat.id` at root or under `body` (simplified test shape plus optional Telegram fields).\n- **Log Incoming Message** POSTs to `$env.ANALYTICS_WEBHOOK_URL` with `messageText`, `chatId`, and `messageId` (analytics-only; not copied to admin alerts).\n- **Prepare Error Log** uses fixed `stage` `chatbot_reply_path`, truncated `errorMessage` from `$json.error`, `workflowName`, `executionId`, and `at`.\n- Credentials: **Telegram Webhook Secret** (inbound header) and **Telegram API** (outbound); **OpenAI API**.\n- OpenAI `prompt.messages[]` with user content from webhook text; Telegram outbound **3 retries**, 5s apart.\n- Error path: **Send Retry Message** to user, **Notify Administrator** to `$env.TELEGRAM_ADMIN_CHAT_ID`; terminal **Stop and Error** on notify failure.\n- Non-text → **Ignore Non-Text**; `/start` → welcome reply without OpenAI."
      },
      "id": "f2a3b4c5-6d7e-8f9a-3b4c-5d6e7f8091a2",
